example"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"485–486"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>506</span><span>507</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"概念依据已据本地DjVu提取文本核对；本地形式表示、直接推论与例子的证据范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=\\{K,a,b,c,d\\}\">\\(\\mathcal F=\\{K,a,b,c,d\\}\\)</span> 为五个互异函数符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(K)=2\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(K)=2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(a)=\\operatorname{ar}(b)=\\operatorname{ar}(c)=\\operatorname{ar}(d)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(a)=\\operatorname{ar}(b)=\\operatorname{ar}(c)=\\operatorname{ar}(d)=0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 不交的可数无限变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ne y\">\\(x\\ne y\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空位置。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Needed}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Needed}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1db927c3e4a86c94\" href=\"?note=1db927c3e4a86c94\" title=\"56-df-needed-redex\">56-df-needed-redex</a>，单步残余见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>。</li>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b1f8b060010b2b2b\" href=\"?note=b1f8b060010b2b2b\" title=\"56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed\">56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed</a> 的非必需判准；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_2,s_2,u_K,u_a,u_c\">\\(R_2,s_2,u_K,u_a,u_c\\)</span> 均由Assertion定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_2:=\\{(K(x,y),x),(a,b),(c,d)\\},\\qquad s_2:=K(a,c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_2:=\\{(K(x,y),x),(a,b),(c,d)\\},\\qquad s_2:=K(a,c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u_K:=(\\epsilon,K(x,y),x),\\qquad\nu_a:=((1),a,b),\\qquad\nu_c:=((2),c,d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u_K:=(\\epsilon,K(x,y),x),\\qquad\nu_a:=((1),a,b),\\qquad\nu_c:=((2),c,d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R_2)\n\\land\\operatorname{Red}_{R_2}(s_2)=\\{u_K,u_a,u_c\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R_2)\n\\land\\operatorname{Red}_{R_2}(s_2)=\\{u_K,u_a,u_c\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s_2,u_K,a)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R_2}\n\\land(a,(\\epsilon,a,b),b)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R_2}\n\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_{R_2},b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s_2,u_K,a)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R_2}\n\\land(a,(\\epsilon,a,b),b)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R_2}\n\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_{R_2},b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_{R_2}((s_2,u_K,a),u_c)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_{R_2}((s_2,u_K,a),u_a)\n=\\{(\\epsilon,a,b)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_{R_2}((s_2,u_K,a),u_c)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_{R_2}((s_2,u_K,a),u_a)\n=\\{(\\epsilon,a,b)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Needed}_{R_2}(s_2,u_K)\n\\land\\operatorname{Needed}_{R_2}(s_2,u_a)\n\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Needed}_{R_2}(s_2,u_c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Needed}_{R_2}(s_2,u_K)\n\\land\\operatorname{Needed}_{R_2}(s_2,u_a)\n\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Needed}_{R_2}(s_2,u_c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是依据原书needed定义构造的本地例子，并非声称原书有此编号例。三条规则正交。任意从K(a,c)到正规形的归约都必须收缩K根，否则根始终为K红项；最终正规形只能是b，因此也必须收缩初始a的一个残余，收缩K可以把该残余移到根。右边c可在K根收缩时直接删除；接a→b即到正规形，按上游定理它不是必需的。可达项恰为K(a,c)、K(b,c)、K(a,d)、K(b,d)、a、b；位置身份说明左a移到根后仍是原a红项的残余，而右c的消失不能冒充它被收缩。</p>\n<p>来源OCR块按本地提取文本的U+001F从1编号；未作机器证明或计算性断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-needed-redex","status":"resolved","id":"1db927c3e4a86c94","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-needed-redex]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed","status":"resolved","id":"b1f8b060010b2b2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-needed-redex","status":"resolved","id":"1db927c3e4a86c94","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$、$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$、$\\operatorname{Red}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-redex]]，单步残余见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]，$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$、$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$、$\\operatorname{Red}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-redex]]，单步残余见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]，$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}$、$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$、$\\operatorname{Red}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-redex]]，单步残余见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]，$\\mathrm{NF}$ 见 [[56-df-normal-form]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed","status":"resolved","id":"b1f8b060010b2b2b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-thm-erased-redex-not-needed]] 的非必需判准；$R_2,s_2,u_K,u_a,u_c$ 均由Assertion定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F=\\{K,a,b,c,d\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(K)=2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(a)=\\operatorname{ar}(b)=\\operatorname{ar}(c)=\\operatorname{ar}(d)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x\\ne y","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Needed}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}","display":false},{"tex":"R_2,s_2,u_K,u_a,u_c","display":false},{"tex":"R_2:=\\{(K(x,y),x),(a,b),(c,d)\\},\\qquad s_2:=K(a,c).","display":true},{"tex":"u_K:=(\\epsilon,K(x,y),x),\\qquad\nu_a:=((1),a,b),\\qquad\nu_c:=((2),c,d).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R_2)\n\\land\\operatorname{Red}_{R_2}(s_2)=\\{u_K,u_a,u_c\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"(s_2,u_K,a)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R_2}\n\\land(a,(\\epsilon,a,b),b)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_{R_2}\n\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_{R_2},b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_{R_2}((s_2,u_K,a),u_c)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_{R_2}((s_2,u_K,a),u_a)\n=\\{(\\epsilon,a,b)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Needed}_{R_2}(s_2,u_K)\n\\land\\operatorname{Needed}_{R_2}(s_2,u_a)\n\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Needed}_{R_2}(s_2,u_c).","display":true}],"bytes":2789,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-ex-needed-and-erased-redex.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1db927c3e4a86c94","b1f8b060010b2b2b","a68d684938525240","e295b2b3159f2b40"]}